-# Hisense 55QD6QF Fire TV (Fire TV Edition, AFTOLCBC82, codename ginza, MediaTek), Fire OS 8.1.8.0 (RS8180.3746N),
-# Android 11 (SDK 30), 1.8 GB of RAM, Canada. Starts from hisense-fire-tv-aftcibfbd1/ and amazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-2023/;
-# each package was checked on this set before listing.
