-# FIRE OS: DEBLOAT ONLY. com.amazon.tv.launcher (Home: .ui.HomeActivity_vNext, priority 950) and
-# com.amazon.firehomestarter are protected (pm disable-user and am force-stop are refused); launcher/ does not apply.
